msgstr "Kidhibiti hakikupatikana."

#: setup.php
msgid "ERROR - Log errors only"
msgstr "HITILAFU - Rekodi hitilafu pekee"

#: setup.php
msgid "WARN  - Log errors and warnings"
msgstr "ONYO  - Rekodi hitilafu na maonyo"

#: setup.php
msgid "INFO  - Log errors, warnings, and info messages"
msgstr "INFO  - Rekodi hitilafu, maonyo, na ujumbe wa taarifa"

#: setup.php
msgid "DEBUG - Log everything"
msgstr "DEBUG - Rekodi kila kitu"

#: setup.php
msgid "Nagios Host Mapping"
msgstr "Ulinganishaji wa Kipangishi cha Nagios"

#: setup.php
msgid "Select the Nagios host that maps to this host."
msgstr "Chagua kipangishi cha Nagios kinachooana na kipangishi hiki."

#: setup.php
msgid "NPC"
msgstr "NPC"

#: setup.php
msgid "Status Detail"
msgstr "Maelezo ya Hali"

#: setup.php
msgid "Service / Host Information"
msgstr "Taarifa za Huduma / Kipangishi"

#: setup.php
msgid "Command Execution"
msgstr "Utekelezaji wa Amri"

#: setup.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Jumla"

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Commands"
msgstr "Amri za Mbali"

#: setup.php
msgid "Allow commands to be written to the Nagios command file."
msgstr "Ruhusu amri ziandikwe kwenye faili ya amri ya Nagios."

#: setup.php
msgid "Nagios Command File Path"
msgstr "Njia ya Faili ya Amri ya Nagios"

#: setup.php
msgid "The path to the Nagios command file (nagios.cmd)."
msgstr "Njia ya kwenda kwenye faili ya amri ya Nagios (nagios.cmd)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Nagios URL"
msgstr "URL ya Nagios"

#: setup.php
msgid "The full URL to your Nagios installation (http://nagios.company.com/nagios/)"
msgstr "URL kamili ya usakinishaji wako wa Nagios (http://nagios.company.com/nagios/)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Date Format"
msgstr "Muundo wa Tarehe"

#: setup.php
msgid "Select the format you want for displaying dates."
msgstr "Chagua umbizo unalotaka la kuonyesha tarehe."

#: setup.php
msgid "Time Format"
msgstr "Muundo wa Muda"

#: setup.php
msgid "Select the format you want for displaying times."
msgstr "Chagua umbizo unalotaka la kuonyesha saa."

#: setup.php
msgid "Portlet Refresh Rate"
msgstr "Kiwango cha Kuonyesha Upya cha Portlet"

#: setup.php
msgid "The amount of time in seconds to wait before the portlets refresh. The minimum is 30 seconds."
msgstr "Muda katika sekunde wa kusubiri kabla ya vijidirisha kusasishwa. Kiwango cha chini ni sekunde 30."

#: setup.php
msgid "Host/Service Config Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Usanidi wa Kipangishi/Huduma"

#: setup.php
msgid "The config type is based on whether or not you are restoring retained information when Nagios starts. If you are unsure just leave the default value. If you can see host and service groups but not hosts or services try changing this setting."
msgstr "Aina ya usanidi inategemea kama unarejesha taarifa zilizohifadhiwa au la wakati Nagios inapoanza. Ikiwa huna uhakika, acha tu thamani chaguo-msingi. Ikiwa unaweza kuona vikundi vya vipangishi na huduma lakini si vipangishi au huduma, jaribu kubadilisha mpangilio huu."

#: setup.php
msgid "Host Icons"
msgstr "Aikoni za Kipangishi"

#: setup.php
msgid "Enable displaying host icons in the hosts grid. The icon_image and icon_image_alt parameters of the Nagios host definition are used to set the image. Icons should be 16x16 to get the best look. this setting does not affect the host status icons."
msgstr "Washa uonyeshaji wa aikoni za kipangishi katika gridi ya vipangishi. Vigezo vya icon_image na icon_image_alt vya ufafanuzi wa kipangishi cha Nagios hutumiwa kuweka picha. Aikoni zinapaswa kuwa 16x16 ili kupata mwonekano bora. mpangilio huu hauathiri aikoni za hali ya kipangishi."

#: setup.php
msgid "Service Icons"
msgstr "Aikoni za Huduma"

#: setup.php
msgid "Enable displaying service icons in the services grid. The icon_image and icon_image_alt parameters of the Nagios service definition are used to set the image. Icons should be 16x16 to get the best look. This setting does not affect the service status icons."
msgstr "Washa uonyeshaji wa aikoni za huduma katika gridi ya huduma. Vigezo vya icon_image na icon_image_alt vya ufafanuzi wa huduma ya Nagios hutumiwa kuweka picha. Aikoni zinapaswa kuwa 16x16 ili kupata mwonekano bora. Mpangilio huu hauathiri aikoni za hali ya huduma."

#: setup.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Kuweka Kumbukumbu"

#: setup.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Kiwango cha Kuweka Kumbukumbu"

#: setup.php
msgid "The level of detail you want sent to the Cacti log file. WARNING: Leaving in DEBUG will quickly fill the cacti log."
msgstr "Kiwango cha maelezo unachotaka yatumwe kwenye faili la kumbukumbu la Cacti. ONYO: Kuiacha katika DEBUG kutajaza haraka kumbukumbu ya cacti."

